# Claims and P0 scope

- P0 is anonymous, free, single PDF, no account or hidden checkout.
- Required copy: Formatting may change. Review your resume after conversion.
- Forbidden: perfect layout, 100% accurate, ATS guaranteed, unverified demand or ranking numbers.
- PRD metrics are planning assumptions until a `vault/09-decisions/` note marks them verified.
- OCR and paid features are P1 and need their own gates.
- If implementation cannot meet a public claim, change the claim first.
